# E2 W5 re-measure, the vLLM PRs' configurations in rounds of their own, round 3 of 5: the KV preemption alone and
# both PRs at the budget cap's 16- and 48-token windows, on make-room as W5's fixes leave it, beside the frozen box,
# every call opening with a warm-up turn. Round N replays w5-rN's sample of the agents (seeds 11 to 15) and runs the
# four in an order rotated by one from round to round, so that each runs in each place.
#   benchmarks/e2/campaign.sh benchmarks/e2/w5-pr-r3.campaign

agents-seed 13

